      "message": "The existing catch-all leaves the EtherType wildcarded and targets the same rx_qp4, so it should already receive PPPoE frames. What NIC/firmware behavior makes explicit EtherType rules necessary here?",
      "revId": "bfd80488eb01ea1308a3261b29a52dedefb82e26",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
