        "filename": "src/plugins/rdma/device.c",
        "patchSetId": 137
      },
      "lineNbr": 318,
      "author": {
        "id": 361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-26T11:04:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we implement VPP flow offload support in the RDMA driver instead of hardcoding PPPoE rules into interface setup? The framework already supports Ethernet flows; adding an RDMA backend would allow configurable EtherType steering without protocol-specific state in the driver.",
      "revId": "bfd80488eb01ea1308a3261b29a52dedefb82e26",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "11387554_674714ab",
        "filename": "src/plugins/rdma/device.c",
        "patchSetId": 137
      },
